<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>org.alienarena.alienarena</id>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">alien-arena.desktop</launchable>
  <name>Alien Arena</name>
  <developer_name>Alien Arena team - previously COR Entertainment</developer_name>
  <summary>Ultra fast paced arena FPS</summary>
  <branding>
    <color type="primary" scheme_preference="light">#b9f1c5</color>
    <color type="primary" scheme_preference="dark">#0c2512</color>
  </branding>
  <content_rating type="oars-1.0">
    <content_attribute id="violence-cartoon">moderate</content_attribute>
    <content_attribute id="violence-fantasy">moderate</content_attribute>
    <content_attribute id="violence-bloodshed">mild</content_attribute>
    <content_attribute id="language-profanity">mild</content_attribute>
    <content_attribute id="language-humor">mild</content_attribute>
    <content_attribute id="social-chat">intense</content_attribute>
    <content_attribute id="social-info">intense</content_attribute>
  </content_rating>
  <description>
    <p>Do you like old school deathmatch with modern features? How about rich, colorful, arcade-like atmospheres? How about...retro Sci Fi? Then you're going to love what Alien Arena has in store for you! This game combines some of the very best aspects of such games as Quake III and Unreal Tournament and wraps them up with a retro alien theme, while adding tons of original ideas to make the game quite unique.</p>
  </description>
